{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車で移動中にシャッと撮ったやつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう、ふとした瞬間の何でもない景色が好きで、\nよく撮ってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、例えば雲の流れとか 電線に止まる鳥とか、\n一度だって同じ景色はないんだと考えると\n全然、何でもなくないんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『FLASHスペシャルグラビアBEST 初夏号』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さんで、ソログラビアさせて頂いてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、発売です。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートにしてから、初めてのグラビアを\nFLASHさんに撮って頂けて嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございます<(__)>お辞儀"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき氷作って食べました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん！  ぱくっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はまだまだ寒い日の撮影で\n雨まで降っちゃって、\n震えながら撮影してました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、楽しかったし美味しかったです(﹡ˆˆ﹡)\n夏らしい感じが伝わってればいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIROOMで、れなちさんが、\n私宛にお手紙を書いてくれました。\nすごく嬉しかったです。(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる方も多いと思いますが、\nれなちさんとは乃木坂加入前から、お互い女優志望で色んなオーディションを受けていた仲間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、私は周りの勧めで自分のスキルアップの為にアイドルのオーディションを受けることになりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうしてまた乃木坂で再会することができて、\n今、再び同じ場所で頑張れていること、\nものすごい奇跡だと思うし、嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なんか先輩としては役立たずだと思うけど、\n仲間として、これからも仲良くしてください(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、こないだうちに泊まりにきてくれて\n朝まで語って楽しかったよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は鑑賞会しよね！！！うひひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/06/24/3231394/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}